1
00:00:02,607 --> 00:00:04,500
居然有人要在餐厅求婚
Got a marriage proposal in the diner.

2
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:05,920
他们要去哪里蜜月呢 "屎"多黎各吗
Where they gonna honeymoon-- a Porta-Potty?

3
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:09,640
这是我见过最悲哀的事情了
That's the saddest thing I ever seen,

4
00:00:09,680 --> 00:00:12,560
比昨晚的滚石老人乐队演唱会还凄惨
and I was at a Rolling Stones concert last night.

5
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:15,760
那男主想我把戒指放到女主的派里
The guy wants me to put this ring her pie.

6
00:00:16,220 --> 00:00:17,140
毕竟有一首歌唱到
'Cause you know what they say--

7
00:00:17,280 --> 00:00:19,300
喜欢它[她] 就给戴上[放进]戒指
If you like it, then you gotta put a ring in it.

8
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:22,260
这也算是头一遭
Well, this is a first.

9
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:25,340
有个男的用吃剩的半个三明治付小费
A guy left me a half a tuna sandwich as a tip.

10
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:28,080
不过这也比穷光蛋欧洲人给的多了
Which is still more than Europeans leave.

11
00:00:30,440 --> 00:00:32,700
四十号桌要求婚
There's a proposal at table 40,

12
00:00:32,740 --> 00:00:34,020
这个任务得你来做
and you have to do it.

13
00:00:34,040 --> 00:00:36,000
我今天已经在餐厅里接生过婴儿了
I already delivered a baby in here today.

14
00:00:37,760 --> 00:00:39,700
看来他们已经好了一段时间了
Well, they've obviously been dating a while,

15
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:41,500
这妞都敢在他面前吃会胖的东西了
'cause she's eating carbs in front of him.

16
00:00:43,593 --> 00:00:44,720
卡洛琳现在超开心
Caroline is so happy right now.

17
00:00:44,720 --> 00:00:46,700
她还相信那些狗屁爱情玩意
She still believes in all that love crap.

18
00:00:47,340 --> 00:00:50,220
她也相信十四号桌是四十号桌
Uh, she also believes table 14 is table 40.

19
00:00:51,760 --> 00:00:53,240
这是您的派
Here's your pie.

20
00:00:53,440 --> 00:00:55,660
我感觉这盘甜点一定会特别"甜"呢
I have a feeling this dessert is gonna be extra-sweet.

21
00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:01,160
这是订婚戒指
It's an engagement ring!

22
00:01:02,440 --> 00:01:03,720
是他藏在派里的
He hid it in the pie!

23
00:01:05,180 --> 00:01:07,400
好 愿意 我愿意嫁给你
Yes! Yes, I'll marry you.

24
00:01:07,580 --> 00:01:09,360
我知道我之前说我不介意等
I know I said I was cool with waiting,

25
00:01:09,460 --> 00:01:11,380
但其实我很介意
but I wasn't cool with it!

26
00:01:14,100 --> 00:01:15,880
她弄错了 这不是你的戒指
Yep. She messed up. This isn't yours.

27
00:01:18,620 --> 00:01:21,360
再说一次 我真的不介意等
Um...again. I'm cool with waiting.

28
00:01:23,520 --> 00:01:26,180
至于你们俩呢 这派免费
And for you two, pie on the house,

29
00:01:26,180 --> 00:01:29,060
我猜回家的出租车上会尴尬死
and I'm guessing a very tense cab ride home.

30
00:01:45,900 --> 00:01:48,220
厄尔上哪了 现在都还没到
Where's Earl? He isn't here yet,

31
00:01:48,220 --> 00:01:49,080
我好担心他
and I'm worried.

32
00:01:49,500 --> 00:01:51,500
等等 今天不是什么黑人假日吧
Wait--it's not a black holiday, is it?

33
00:01:52,980 --> 00:01:55,140
厄尔最好不是死了 不然我一定杀了他
Earl better not be dead, or I'll kill him.

34
00:01:56,180 --> 00:01:57,880
我们有一个大麻自杀协议
We have a joint suicide pact.

35
00:01:58,360 --> 00:02:00,260
我们一起抽一管大麻 然后自杀
We smoke a joint and then we kill ourselves.

36
00:02:01,520 --> 00:02:04,100
他可能只是迟到而已 不用反应过度
He's probably just late. Don't overreact.

37
00:02:04,560 --> 00:02:07,340
我十分钟前打给911 跟接线小姐抓狂
That's exactly what Janine at 911 said ten minutes ago

38
00:02:07,340 --> 00:02:08,520
她也说了你说的话
when I overreacted with her!

39
00:02:09,740 --> 00:02:10,358
你居然打给911了
You called 911?

40
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:13,420
我昨晚晚回家三个小时而已
When I came home three hours late last night,

41
00:02:13,420 --> 00:02:15,360
你就已经把我所有的东西都搬到街上去了
you had already put all my stuff out on the street.

42
00:02:16,720 --> 00:02:17,660
大家安安
Hi, everybody!

43
00:02:20,480 --> 00:02:22,580
等等 厄尔人呢
Wait a minute-- where's Earl?

44
00:02:23,220 --> 00:02:24,960
少了他坐下面看我巨乳
It's not as much fun walking in here

45
00:02:24,960 --> 00:02:27,180
我进店里的乐趣就少了好多啊
if he's not down there looking up at my boobs.

46
00:02:28,660 --> 00:02:29,520
他迟到
He's late.

47
00:02:30,580 --> 00:02:31,140
"迟到"吗
Late?

48
00:02:32,420 --> 00:02:34,440
节哀 麦克斯
Oh...I'm sorry, Max.

49
00:02:34,460 --> 00:02:36,880
我知道你们情同父女
I know you two were close.

50
00:02:37,980 --> 00:02:40,660
看到没 我跟你还有接线员说这事的时候
See? That's the kind of sympathy I was looking for

51
00:02:40,660 --> 00:02:41,600
想要的就是这种同情慰问
from you and Janine.

52
00:02:43,740 --> 00:02:45,160
苏菲 这一大堆针是干嘛的
Sophie, what's with those needles?

53
00:02:45,480 --> 00:02:47,160
准备拿来打针用的
Oh, yeah--I'm getting ready to shoot up.

54
00:02:49,380 --> 00:02:51,620
苏菲今天要开始打排卵针
Sophie's starting her fertility shots today.

55
00:02:51,980 --> 00:02:53,560
不久之后 我们就能为人父母了
Before long, we'll be parents.

56
00:02:53,560 --> 00:02:55,020
小心了 未来的PTA[家长会]
Look out, PTA meetings...

57
00:02:55,380 --> 00:02:57,680
我负责带P[阴茎] 她负责带TA[奶+臀]
I'll bring the P. She'll bring the T&A.

58
00:02:58,500 --> 00:03:00,820
来吧 奥列格 我准备好打第一针了
All right, come on, Oleg. I'm ready for my first shot.

59
00:03:01,160 --> 00:03:02,520
走吧 咱们去女厕
Come on, let's go to the ladies' room

60
00:03:02,520 --> 00:03:04,200
这样你能好好"捅"我一针
so you can poke me real good.

61
00:03:05,540 --> 00:03:07,960
你不准在餐厅里任何地方"捅"她
You're not poking her anywhere in here.

62
00:03:08,220 --> 00:03:11,500
多谢你们 现在残疾人厕所成了套套乱葬岗
Thanks to you, the handicap stall is a condom graveyard!

63
00:03:13,100 --> 00:03:15,660
苏菲 我这辈子只怕两样东西
Sophie, you know I'm only afraid of two things--

64
00:03:15,820 --> 00:03:18,020
针头与眼睑拉皮后的歌手肯尼·罗杰斯
needles and Kenny Rogers after the eyelift.

65
00:03:19,700 --> 00:03:21,620
他不知道什么时候该折起眼皮
He did not know when to fold 'em.

66
00:03:23,900 --> 00:03:25,860
得找别人帮你打这个针
Someone else will have to give you your shots.

67
00:03:26,380 --> 00:03:27,980
我可以帮忙
Well, I guess I could do it.

68
00:03:28,420 --> 00:03:29,160
把袖子卷起来吧
Roll up your sleeve.

69
00:03:30,700 --> 00:03:31,740
好吧 行
Okay, yeah.

70
00:03:31,740 --> 00:03:33,220
我就卷起我的袖子
I'll roll up my sleeve...

71
00:03:33,220 --> 00:03:35,400
再脱下我的塑身裤
and then pull down my Spanx,

72
00:03:35,640 --> 00:03:37,860
你得把针扎到我那"阳光不闪耀之处"
'cause you gotta put it where the sun don't shine, baby.

73
00:03:39,800 --> 00:03:41,940
这有点尴尬啊 苏菲
Uh...this is a little awkward, but Sophie,

74
00:03:41,960 --> 00:03:44,800
我原先真不知道得帮你在丰臀扎针
I was unaware I'd be injecting your badonkadonk.

75
00:03:47,080 --> 00:03:47,608
好了 阿憨
Okay, Han.

76
00:03:48,380 --> 00:03:49,720
牵我的手
Take my hand...

77
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:51,640
没错
That's right.

78
00:03:52,500 --> 00:03:55,520
这就对了 来吧
That's real good. All right, come on.

79
00:03:55,520 --> 00:03:56,940
我现在要带你去
And I'm gonna take you now

80
00:03:56,940 --> 00:03:59,200
见识你人生第一个女人屁股
to show you your first lady butt.

81
00:04:04,720 --> 00:04:06,820
这如此温暖有爱的一幕
Now, there's a heart-warming tableau

82
00:04:06,820 --> 00:04:08,720
插画家洛克威尔不知怎么地错过了啊
that Norman Rockwell somehow missed.

83
00:04:10,420 --> 00:04:11,740
姑娘们晚上好
Hello, ladies.

84
00:04:12,760 --> 00:04:14,900
厄尔 你还活着我好庆幸
Earl! I'm so glad you're alive.

85
00:04:15,420 --> 00:04:17,860
麦克斯 你每次总是直接想到我挂了
You always go straight to dead, Max.

86
00:04:18,920 --> 00:04:21,260
不过还是谢谢你帮我叫了医务人员
But thanks for sending the paramedics.

87
00:04:21,260 --> 00:04:23,840
我的确需要有人来帮我找苹果电视盒遥控
I needed help finding my Apple TV remote.

88
00:04:26,020 --> 00:04:28,100
我跟巴里电话说太久
I was stuck on the phone with Barry

89
00:04:28,100 --> 00:04:30,200
他是我以前"早鸟"爵士乐队的伙伴
from my old jazz band The Early Birds.

90
00:04:30,760 --> 00:04:33,220
你在《从未闯出名堂》杂志上可能看过我们
You may have read about us in "Never Made It" magazine.

91
00:04:34,620 --> 00:04:36,400
我跟卡洛琳还是上周的封面人物呢
Caroline and I were on the cover last week.

92
00:04:38,320 --> 00:04:41,620
他跟我说露比爵士酒吧要办周年纪念演出
He told me they are holding a anniversary show down at Ruby's,

93
00:04:41,620 --> 00:04:43,820
而这周五晚我们早鸟乐队
and The Early Birds are invited to perform

94
00:04:43,820 --> 00:04:44,900
被邀请去演出
on Friday night.

95
00:04:45,659 --> 00:04:47,490
厄尔
Earl!

96
00:04:47,500 --> 00:04:50,460
我其中一个梦想就是看你现场演出
One of my dreams is to hear you play live.

97
00:04:50,460 --> 00:04:52,540
而另一个梦想已经实现了
And the other one already happened--

98
00:04:53,040 --> 00:04:54,240
麦当劳早餐全天都卖
breakfast all day at McDonald's.

99
00:04:55,500 --> 00:04:57,680
麦克斯 我不想戳破你麦满分般的幻想
Well, I hate to burst your McMuffin, Max,

100
00:04:57,700 --> 00:04:59,400
但你的梦想不会实现了
but that ain't gonna happen,

101
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:01,380
因为我没被邀请去演出
'cause I'm not invited to play.

102
00:05:01,820 --> 00:05:02,960
露比不想看到我
Ruby doesn't want me there.

103
00:05:03,080 --> 00:05:04,660
露比恨厄尔
Ruby hates Earl.

104
00:05:05,200 --> 00:05:07,260
那麦克斯就恨露比
Well, then Max hates Ruby.

105
00:05:08,780 --> 00:05:11,080
你跟露比之间是发生了什么呀
Oh! What happened between you and Ruby?

106
00:05:11,340 --> 00:05:12,840
一场疯狂的风流韵事吗
Was it a crazy love affair?

107
00:05:13,960 --> 00:05:15,200
的确是十分热辣
We were hot.

108
00:05:16,560 --> 00:05:17,922
"疯狂的爱"吗[法语]
Oh! An amour fou?

109
00:05:19,060 --> 00:05:21,940
不 是我跟人家妹妹"疯狂爱爱"了
No, it was a-more I fooled around with her sister.

110
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:30,900
看 厄尔与早鸟乐队的唱片
Look! Earl and The Early Birds!

111
00:05:31,220 --> 00:05:32,120
你从哪弄来的
Where'd you get that?

112
00:05:32,480 --> 00:05:34,380
我去唱片店买的
I went down the street to Smart & Vinyl.

113
00:05:37,220 --> 00:05:39,300
你花12.95块买厄尔的唱片
You spent 12.95 on Earl's record,

114
00:05:39,300 --> 00:05:42,260
可是昨天我买咖啡差2毛5你却不借我钱
but you wouldn't lend me 25 cents for a latte yesterday?

115
00:05:44,240 --> 00:05:46,400
我们必须得想办法帮帮厄尔
Look, we gotta do something about Earl.

116
00:05:46,460 --> 00:05:48,240
在那爵士酒吧表演的机会是他应得的
He deserves to play at that jazz club.

117
00:05:48,240 --> 00:05:49,800
他可是我们这餐厅里
I mean, he is the only one at this diner

118
00:05:49,800 --> 00:05:51,020
最有机会闯出名堂的人了
who has a chance to make it.

119
00:05:54,160 --> 00:05:57,080
我很欣赏你的热情 但餐厅的所有人中
I appreciate your enthusiasm, but of all of us here,

120
00:05:57,080 --> 00:05:59,780
你觉得是这位80岁老人的未来最光明吗
you think the 80-year-old has the brightest future?

121
00:06:00,700 --> 00:06:02,080
从我一开始认识厄尔到现在
For as long as I've known Earl,

122
00:06:02,240 --> 00:06:04,760
他嘴上总是挂着他有多为那乐团骄傲
all he talked about is how proud he was of that band.

123
00:06:04,840 --> 00:06:06,060
而这个就叫露比的女人
And that Ruby woman

124
00:06:06,060 --> 00:06:08,060
居然想要阻挡他再次演出的机会
is denying him the chance to play again?

125
00:06:08,260 --> 00:06:09,460
有我在[手表] 就不可能
Not on my watch.

126
00:06:09,600 --> 00:06:10,960
如果我有一只
If I own one.

127
00:06:11,540 --> 00:06:12,860
不过... 我没有
Which...I do not.

128
00:06:14,820 --> 00:06:16,503
我们得去那家酒吧
We are going down to that club

129
00:06:16,700 --> 00:06:17,740
跟露比讲讲道理
and talk some sense into Ruby,

130
00:06:17,740 --> 00:06:20,100
如果我们有点才华 厄尔也会为我们出头
because Earl would do the same for us if we had any talent.

131
00:06:21,340 --> 00:06:22,500
我不得不问
I just have to ask--

132
00:06:22,520 --> 00:06:24,420
你真心觉得我们有天能离开这里的吧
you do think we're gonna get out of here one day.

133
00:06:24,640 --> 00:06:25,740
当然啊
Oh, for sure!

134
00:06:25,920 --> 00:06:27,000
在装尸袋里被送出去
In body bags.

135
00:06:37,460 --> 00:06:39,740
这地方真像那么回事
Wow, this place is the real deal!

136
00:06:39,960 --> 00:06:41,980
很多爵士大家都在这里唱过
All the jazz greats sang here.

137
00:06:42,100 --> 00:06:45,080
艾拉·费兹洁拉 萨拉·沃恩 妮娜·西蒙
Look--Ella Fitzgerald, Sarah Vaughan, Nina Simone.

138
00:06:45,300 --> 00:06:47,120
你知道曾经有段时间我也想...
You know, there was a moment when I wanted to be--

139
00:06:47,530 --> 00:06:48,761
你有过任何时间是你想安静闭嘴的吗
Was there ever a moment when you wanted to be quiet?

140
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:53,180
麻烦来杯免费的威士忌
Scotch on the house, please.

141
00:06:54,420 --> 00:06:56,100
我通常下午不喝酒
Normally, I don't drink in the afternoon,

142
00:06:56,100 --> 00:06:57,200
但现在还是早上
but it's still morning.

143
00:06:59,880 --> 00:07:00,660
我要杯利莱酒
I'll have a Lillet.

144
00:07:01,200 --> 00:07:03,280
我听说比莉·荷莉戴[歌手]就爱喝这个
I hear it was Billie Holiday's poison.

145
00:07:03,560 --> 00:07:04,720
曾有过一段时间我...
You know, there was a moment when I was--

146
00:07:04,720 --> 00:07:05,420
那段时间已经过去了
That moment's over.

147
00:07:06,760 --> 00:07:08,460
先生 我们来找露比
Sir, we're here to see Ruby.

148
00:07:09,600 --> 00:07:11,140
谁想见露比
Who wants to see Ruby?

149
00:07:14,320 --> 00:07:15,940
麦克斯 她来势汹汹啊
She's coming in real hot, Max.

150
00:07:15,940 --> 00:07:17,300
来找她可能不是好主意
Maybe this isn't a good idea.

151
00:07:17,780 --> 00:07:19,500
世界上唯一让我害怕的老女人只有一个
There's only one old woman who scares me,

152
00:07:19,520 --> 00:07:20,680
他的名字叫史蒂芬·泰勒
and his name is Steven Tyler.

153
00:07:22,580 --> 00:07:23,200
我就是露比
I'm Ruby.

154
00:07:23,740 --> 00:07:25,420
这不就是
Well...if it isn't

155
00:07:25,420 --> 00:07:27,420
"不邀请人参加活动女士"吗
"Miss doesn't invite people to stuff."

156
00:07:28,320 --> 00:07:31,180
也是大家熟知的"非常非常漂亮女士"
Who's also known as Miss Very, Very Pretty.

157
00:07:32,120 --> 00:07:34,400
本美女不需要别人告诉我我漂亮
I don't need someone to tell me that I'm pretty.

158
00:07:34,540 --> 00:07:35,740
当年我也是这么对为我写出
That's what I told Roy Orbison

159
00:07:35,740 --> 00:07:37,380
《漂亮女人》的罗伊·奥比森说
when he wrote "Pretty Woman" for me.

160
00:07:38,000 --> 00:07:39,060
你们俩姑娘来做什么
What do you little girls want?

161
00:07:40,360 --> 00:07:41,660
我们是厄尔的朋友
We're friends of Earl.

162
00:07:41,980 --> 00:07:43,500
-哪个厄尔 -那个厄尔啊
- Of Earl? - You know, Earl.

163
00:07:43,500 --> 00:07:44,560
早鸟乐队那个
From The Early Birds.

164
00:07:44,560 --> 00:07:46,780
就是让这酒吧蓬荜生辉的那个厄尔
You know, the guy who put this club on the map.

165
00:07:47,540 --> 00:07:48,760
那个厄尔啊
Oh, that Earl!

166
00:07:49,320 --> 00:07:50,220
他是个废柴渣男
He's a bum!

167
00:07:51,800 --> 00:07:53,160
八婆 你最好掂掂自己斤两
Girl, you better check yourself!

168
00:07:55,860 --> 00:07:58,300
不许有任何人说我的厄尔坏话
No one says anything bad about my Earl.

169
