我不需要毒品也能上台
I don't need junk to get up there.

382
00:17:18,560 --> 00:17:20,940
只要卡洛琳开口唱歌就行
I just needed Caroline to start singing.

383
00:17:21,640 --> 00:17:22,700
起飞吧 鸟儿们
Let's fly, Birds.

384
00:17:23,360 --> 00:17:24,820
A-five, six, seven, eight.

385
00:17:36,120 --> 00:17:38,100
谢谢你热场 亲爱的
Thanks for warming them up, darling.

386
